WEBVTT

00:04:56.459 --> 00:05:00.004
And that's why my colleagues
and I found ourselves

00:05:00.004 --> 00:05:02.840
in clandestine meetings all over Europe.

00:05:03.299 --> 00:05:05.134
We were making the case

00:05:05.176 --> 00:05:08.637
that Israel should be used
as a staging area

00:05:08.637 --> 00:05:13.184
for the outbound delivery
of international humanitarian aid.

00:05:13.642 --> 00:05:17.646
We lobbied the UK Parliament,
the EU Parliament,

00:05:17.688 --> 00:05:19.190
the Canadian Parliament.

00:05:19.231 --> 00:05:21.359
We banged on doors in Congress.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.320
We met with every level
of government in Israel.

00:05:24.362 --> 00:05:25.488
And ...

00:05:26.739 --> 00:05:27.948
We got nowhere.

00:05:29.825 --> 00:05:31.452
But then it happened.